  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neema Poultry Enterprise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Poultry.Beneficiaries: Women.Summary: The project funds will be used to construct poultry houses with solar electricity systems; and to purchase inputs to the business including hens; poultry feed; and medications; allowing Neemato expand into new markets. Neemamembers will receive ongoing training in poultry health and basic bookkeeping.</narrative>
  </description>
